e plane isn't  named in the movie the first scene in  which tales flies it features a massive  tornado because in the games the plane  is called the tornado that wasn't too  bad  the climax of sonic the hedgehog 2 sonic  finally unlocks the power of the seven  chaos emeralds and transforms into super  sonic the glowing golden form that lets  him fly around at even faster speeds and  blatantly rip off dragon ball z without  violating copyright it's a great moment  for fans of the games as most of them  end with similar battles between  supersonic and some giant enemy the  nature of supersonic has changed a bit  in the movie but not in any real major  ways in the games a heightened form  rapidly drains energy from sonic often  rings which doesn't happen in the movie  the film's supersonic design is spot on  however and the ensuing battle very much  reads like one of classic showdowns from  the games  of course sonic the hedgehog 2 wouldn't  be a modern adventure film without at  least one post-credits scene to set up  the next installment and this film  reveals a secret black ops site and an  initiative called project shadow  shadow it's you  the way in which shadow is introduced  also hints at some smaller details for  the franchise's future which many  viewers may miss  invoking the project shadow name  suggests that the movies are sticking  pretty close to the storyline of sonic  adventure 2 which was shadow's debut in  that game he's discovered by dr eggman  in the deaths of a gun research facility  called prison island where he's been  frozen for decades that could be the  same location glimpse in the sonic 2  post-credits scene of course it's  unlikely that the family-friendly sonic  films will ever dive too deep down  shadow's edgy side but there are a lot  of interesting possibilities  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

